# Qoduck — findings by Inkling 2 Small

- Source: Alibaba Cloud / Qoder (`qoduck`)
- Date: 2026-11-10 (UTC) — deep second pass 2026-11-10
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Qoduck
- **Short description:** Alibaba Cloud's anonymous "stealth model" shipped inside the Qoder International desktop app on 2026-11-07. Official wording: "a stealth model whose identity has yet to be disclosed" — no model card, no weights, no API, no benchmark table. Individual-use promotional drop, not a public release. Community fingerprint analysis places it in the Qwen family (tokenizer match); it is widely speculated to be Qwen4-27B, but Alibaba has confirmed nothing.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder International desktop app, individual tiers only (Free / Pro Trial / Lite / Pro / Pro+ / Ultra); NOT available via Qoder IDE, JetBrains plugin, CLI, Teams/Enterprise, or any public API/endpoint. `lmodel` upstream routing key per reverse-engineered client catalogs (unverified).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-11-07 (promo window "yet to be determined"; originally announced as ending 2026-11-11 10:00 UTC+8, extendible at Qoder's discretion).
- **IDs:** none public. Served only as "Qoduck" in the Qoder model picker; upstream key `lmodel` reported by gateway reverse-engineering (unconfirmed).
- **Context window:** ~1,000,000 tokens — community/client-reported (Kie.ai, stealthmodels.com); NOT stated in Qoder's docs. Treat as unverified.
- **Modalities:** text/code in, text/code out; "multimodal inputs observed" per community testing only — unconfirmed. Reasoning yes (Thinking Intensity slider incl. "Extreme", tokens covered by 0.0x promo rate).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** promotional 0.0× Credit rate inside the daily free allowance (no Credits, even at max thinking intensity); after the allowance, standard 0.5× Credit multiplier ≈ flagship tier (same factor as Qwen3.8-Max; Qwen3.8-Flash sits at 0.1× per Qoder's rate card). No per-token price exists.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed. Speculation splits between (a) dense 27B (~35 GB at Q8, "Qwen4-27B" reading from @teortaxesTex, disputed by OrcaRouter's own arithmetic), and (b) sparse MoE with a learned n-gram/MTP memory (Flash-Next-style precursor, Qwen3.8-Flash-Next config confirms `qwen4_exp` architecture exists upstream). Kernel PRs (analytics-zoo #22 vLLM-XPU, t-head/pla #11) name "Qwen4-27B dense" and "Qwen4.0-Max" — preparation artifacts, not a release, no end-to-end run.

