ZERO verified public benchmark scores found — for this exact model/ID, anywhere. Confirmed across 11 successful independent searches/lookups on 2026-11-10 (official docs, OpenAI/xAI/HF/models.dev/BenchLM catalogs, HN, GitHub, and independent press). Leaked "Qwen4 = 82% SWE-bench" / "53 on AA" claims all trace to no primary source (Stealth Models leak audit, 2026-11-02: "Count the footprints. Do not count the guesses as scores.").

